      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEKLA DIVA (3) settled close to the pace the went to the front and kept finding to win for the second time in a row last start over 1780m at Northam, getting there by 3.5 metres. Has the benefit of a good draw. Good enough to take out a race like this. WELLOILED (2) produced a solid effort last time out when she scored by 1.1 metres over 1823m at Narrogin. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Finds a nice race and will be a major force once more. RUN BOB RUN (7) found one better two runs back then things went sour last time when he broke and finished 13 metres back in fourth over 2503m at Gloucester Park. Gets a soft run on the inside of the second line but may need luck at some point. Has the talent to make his presence felt. ICANPLAY (4) is in the mix following a fourth at her most recent appearance over 2242m at Narrogin.",
